noncomputable def normalizedTracePolynomial_excitationDomainWitness_of_analysisImage_range_of_factorized_inner_self_pos
    (Q : PhysicalYangMillsEvenPeriodicWilsonOSCoherentPositiveTimePullback S D halfExtent 2 actualAnalysisExcitationDomainWitnessTwoRankPositive beta hbeta)
